Package: linux-modules-x86-64
Version: {{ VER }}
Architecture: {{ ARCH }}
Maintainer: Gabriel Guillou <guillou.gabriel@gmail.com>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: linux-image-{{ KVER }} (= {{ VER }})
Description: Device-specific kernel modules for x86-64
 This package contains the kernel modules specific to the x86-64
 device overlay (NVMe, AHCI, physical NIC drivers, USB host
 controllers). It is built on top of linux-image-common and must be
 installed alongside it.
